(6: (meta: (t: semantic) (n: 1) (term: string%20value) (def: %23%23%20Summary%0A%0AIssue%20%233%20is%20a%20planning%2Fresearch%20issue%3A%20plan%20full%20in%2Fout%20processing%20for%20the%20top-10%20programming%20languages%2C%20top-10%20natural%20languages%2C%20and%20mixed-mode%20txt%2FMarkdown%2FHTML%3B%20copy%20competitor%20test%20coverage%20into%20a%20migration%20plan%3B%20and%20compile%20the%20supporting%20data%20into%20%60docs%2Fcase-studies%2Fissue-3%2F%60.%0A%0AThis%20PR%20adds%20that%20case%20study%20folder.%20It%20is%20documentation-only%3A%20no%20runtime%20or%20%60src%2F%60%20changes.%0A%0AAfter%20maintainer%20feedback%20on%20PR%20%234%2C%20the%20planned%20implementation%20issues%20were%20created%20with%20%60gh%60%20and%20are%20now%20tracked%20as%20real%20GitHub%20issues%20%235%20through%20%2320.%20The%20source%20specs%20and%20idempotent%20creation%20script%20remain%20in%20%60docs%2Fcase-studies%2Fissue-3%2Fproposed-issues%2F%60.%0A%0ACloses%20%233.%0A%0A%23%23%20Filed%20Implementation%20Issues%0A%0A%7C%20Issue%20%7C%20Area%20%7C%0A%7C---%7C---%7C%0A%7C%20%235%20%7C%20Plain-text%20%28%60txt%60%29%20as%20a%20first-class%20container%20target%20%7C%0A%7C%20%236%20%7C%20Natural-language%20ordering%20convention%20%7C%0A%7C%20%237%20%7C%20tree-sitter%20universal%20lossless%20parser%20front-end%20%7C%0A%7C%20%238%20%7C%20Mixed-mode%20embedding%20via%20tree-sitter%20injection%20%7C%0A%7C%20%239%20%7C%20Natural-language%20segmentation%20and%20identification%20%7C%0A%7C%20%2310%20%7C%20Visual%20Basic%20grammar%20gap%20%7C%0A%7C%20%2311%20%7C%20SQL%20dialect%20grammars%20%7C%0A%7C%20%2312%20%7C%20Delphi%2FObject%20Pascal%20grammar%20%7C%0A%7C%20%2313%20%7C%20Substitution%2Fquery%20matcher%20enrichment%20%7C%0A%7C%20%2314%20%7C%20Persistent%20immutable%20snapshots%20%7C%0A%7C%20%2315%20%7C%20Unified%20query%20%2B%20transform%20surface%20%7C%0A%7C%20%2316%20%7C%20Self-description%20roots%20as%20links%20%7C%0A%7C%20%2317%20%7C%20Common%20concept%20ontology%20%7C%0A%7C%20%2318%20%7C%20Cross-language%20reconstruction%20%2B%20configurable%20formalization%20%7C%0A%7C%20%2319%20%7C%20External%20competitor%20test%20corpora%20%7C%0A%7C%20%2320%20%7C%20Ecosystem%20test%20corpora%20%7C%0A%0AThe%20filed%20issue%20bodies%20were%20refreshed%20from%20the%20source%20specs%20after%20issue%20numbers%20were%20known%2C%20so%20dependencies%20now%20point%20at%20real%20issues%20%28for%20example%2C%20%238%2C%20%2310%2C%20%2311%2C%20%2312%2C%20%2315%2C%20and%20%2319%20reference%20%237%29.%0A%0A%23%23%20What%27s%20In%20The%20Case%20Study%0A%0A%7C%20File%20%7C%20What%20it%20is%20%7C%0A%7C---%7C---%7C%0A%7C%20%60README.md%60%20%7C%20Overview%2C%20key%20findings%2C%20document%20index%2C%20and%20filed-issue%20status.%20%7C%0A%7C%20%60requirements.md%60%20%7C%20Traceable%20register%20of%20every%20requirement%20from%20issue%20%233%20and%20issue%20%231.%20%7C%0A%7C%20%60solution-plans.md%60%20%7C%20One%20solution%20per%20requirement%20cluster%2C%20build-vs-reuse%20decisions%2C%20and%20the%20six-phase%20plan.%20%7C%0A%7C%20%60rust-libraries-survey.md%60%20%7C%20Reusable%20Rust%20crates%20and%20grammar%20gaps.%20%7C%0A%7C%20%60competitor-test-suites.md%60%20%7C%20External%20suites%2C%20formats%2C%20licenses%2C%20and%20adaptation%20plans.%20%7C%0A%7C%20%60ecosystem-foundations.md%60%20%7C%20link-foundation%2Flinksplatform%20ecosystem%20parity%20and%20corrected%20figures.%20%7C%0A%7C%20%60online-research.md%60%20%7C%20TIOBE%20May%202026%2C%20Ethnologue%202025%2C%20license%20safety%2C%20and%20fact-checks.%20%7C%0A%7C%20%60proposed-issues%2F%60%20%7C%20Source%20specs%20for%20filed%20issues%20%235-%2320%20plus%20%60create-issues.sh%60.%20%7C%0A%7C%20%60raw-data%2F%60%20%7C%20GitHub%20JSON%20for%20issue%2FPR%20context%20plus%20%60implementation-issues-5-20.json%60.%20%7C%0A%0A%23%23%20Key%20Findings%0A%0A-%20The%20crate%20is%20a%20well-scoped%20scaffold%3A%20public%20contract%20and%20parity%20tracking%20exist%3B%20real%20grammar%20integration%2C%20concept%20ontology%20work%2C%20persistent%20storage%2C%20and%20corpus%20adoption%20remain%20implementation%20work.%0A-%20%60txt%60%20was%20the%20one%20untracked%20explicit%20coverage%20target%3B%20it%20is%20now%20tracked%20by%20%235.%0A-%20Reuse%20is%20the%20preferred%20path%3A%20tree-sitter%20covers%207%2F10%20programming%20targets%20immediately%2C%20while%20Visual%20Basic%2C%20SQL%20dialects%2C%20and%20Delphi%2FObject%20Pascal%20need%20separate%20grammar%20work.%0A-%20External%20and%20ecosystem%20competitor%20corpora%20are%20license-compatible%20and%20decomposed%20into%20%2319%20and%20%2320.%0A%0A%23%23%20Verification%0A%0A-%20Created%20issues%20%235-%2320%20with%20%60.%2Fdocs%2Fcase-studies%2Fissue-3%2Fproposed-issues%2Fcreate-issues.sh%20--create%60.%0A-%20Re-ran%20the%20script%20in%20dry-run%20mode%3A%200%20would%20create%2C%2016%20skipped%20as%20existing.%0A-%20%60cargo%20fmt%20--check%60%0A-%20%60cargo%20clippy%20--all-targets%20--all-features%60%0A-%20%60cargo%20test%20--all-features%60%20%2871%20passed%29%0A-%20%60rust-script%20scripts%2Fcheck-no-src-tests.rs%60%0A-%20%60rust-script%20scripts%2Fcheck-file-size.rs%60%0A-%20%60rust-script%20scripts%2Fcheck-crate-size.rs%60%20%28crate%20archive%200.06%20MiB%29%0A-%20%60git%20diff%20--check%60%0A) (lang: meta-language%20structured%20data)))
